#. module: obox_point_of_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:obox_point_of_sale.field_pos_printer__proxy_obox_id
msgid ""
"\n"
"        In the Self Ordering context, customer are not on the same\n"
"        network as the printer, so we need to use an Obox device as a\n"
"        proxy to send print jobs to the printer."
msgstr ""

#. module: obox_point_of_sale
#: model:ir.model,name:obox_point_of_sale.model_obox_queue
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Queue is just a model to store actions to be performed by the Obox\n"
"        devices. The devices will fetch the next action to perform using\n"
"        the get_next_action method, which will return the action and mark\n"
"        it as processed in an atomic way to avoid conflicts.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

